menu "Status LED"

    config STATUS_LED_GPIO
        int "Addressable (WS2812) LED GPIO"
        default 38
        help
            ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 v1.1 has its RGB LED on GPIO38; v1.0 has it on GPIO48.

    config STATUS_LED_BRIGHTNESS_PERCENT
        int "Brightness cap (percent)"
        range 1 100
        default 20
        help
            A WS2812 at full power is blinding. Every color, including the ones set
            from the web UI, is scaled by this percentage.

endmenu
